task.tlm_smart_combat.smart_combat.desc:
Smart combat mode:
- Focuses the visible hostile mob with the highest current health;
- Continuously evaluates every weapon in the backpack against the current target and swaps the best one (melee / bow / crossbow / trident) into the main hand;
- Equips a shield in the offhand for melee combat, otherwise a totem of undying;
- Automatically wears the best helmet / chestplate / leggings / boots found in the backpack.
